=== parse-illegal-escape.watsup ===
error[parse/text-escape-invalid]: escape `\q` is not allowed in a text literal
  ┌─ parse/parse-illegal-escape.watsup:3:5
  │
3 │ "abc\qdef"
  │     ^^ invalid escape
  │
  = Supported escapes are \n, \r, \t, \\, \', \", \HH (two hexadecimal digits for one byte), and \u{HEX} (a Unicode scalar value).

